The people in the organisation, including the management, have the security competence that their work needs, and they know their responsibilities.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is required when the organisation runs an ISMS, or when NIS2 applies. NIS2 requires training for the management bodies, and basic cyber hygiene practices and training for the employees. The competence of a development project team is managed in its project.

== How to implement

Make a training and awareness plan for the year. Name the target groups, the training, and the awareness activities, for example phishing exercises. Keep records of who took part.

